{"id":"wb-5-268","name":"崇明寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"崇明寺","text":"崇明寺为中华人民共和国山西省高平市的一座佛寺，位于河西镇郭家庄村西侧，俗称狼谷寺。崇明寺坐北朝南，共两进院落，现存山门、钟鼓楼、中佛殿、后佛殿及东西配殿，其中中佛殿为北宋原构，余为明清建筑。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B4%87%E6%98%8E%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":95339963,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95339963","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/cb6eaac7a96a3e7a39823da3.jpg","title":"20260828_Chongming_Temple_10.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260828_Chongming_Temple_10.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/47/20260828_Chongming_Temple_10.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​全国重点文物保护单位 山西高平 崇明寺 中佛殿","width":320,"height":214}}